{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb2bTUzRob4PzLpCqSrP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I implemented the four Shelf rpcs in `shelf.go`, but I haven't run `./check.sh`. Bash was denied in this session, so the build and the scenarios are untested.\n\n- **AddItem:** an empty name or a negative quantity returns INVALID_ARGUMENT. A name that violates the table's unique constraint returns ALREADY_EXISTS. A quantity of zero is stored.\n- **GetItem and RemoveItem:** a missing id returns NOT_FOUND.\n- **ListItems:** returns every stored item ordered by id.\n\nThe ALREADY_EXISTS check matches the string \"UNIQUE\" in the SQLite error text. I didn't add tests, since the project has no test convention beyond the spec scenarios.\n\nI didn't touch `go.mod` or `main.go`. The earlier `go get example.com/toybuild/gen/toy/v1` failure should have come from the unimplemented service, but I couldn't confirm that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1620,"cache_read_input_tokens":17700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1620},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"025f620c-405e-4060-9816-e76d0ba6c1b0","uuid":"a3426355-78f9-4e0a-a1f0-29cebf7769e4","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:02.517Z","request_id":"req_011Cgb2bTGqVqBuHwYLtXhLr"}
