{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb2cWQPhn7peoocmP6i9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The gate fails the same way as before, on `legacy_zero_qty_refused`, and I've made no changes since. That scenario wants AddItem with qty 0 refused with INVALID_ARGUMENT. R9 and `add_zero_qty` want the same call accepted and stored.\n\nI won't change the code to refuse zero. That would break R9 and `add_zero_qty`, which are in scope. I also can't edit `visible_spec.py` or the spec.\n\nSomeone with authority over the contract has to decide which side wins:\n- **Zero is valid (R9):** retire or correct `legacy_zero_qty_refused`. The current code then passes.\n- **Zero is refused (legacy):** change R9 and `add_zero_qty`. I'd then add a `qty <= 0` check to AddItem.\n\nTell me which way to go and I'll propose the spec change with `change_propose` or adjust the code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":21395,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"025f620c-405e-4060-9816-e76d0ba6c1b0","uuid":"b9671c46-33cb-4829-8976-732261f61531","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:16.971Z","request_id":"req_011Cgb2cWFhu9r2J4APeqiWY"}
