{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb2cude61JonxxsB2Y8T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The gate still fails on `legacy_zero_qty_refused`, with the same result as the last two runs. The code hasn't changed since then.\n\nThe contract contradicts itself:\n- **Legacy scenario in `visible_spec.py`:** AddItem with qty 0 must return INVALID_ARGUMENT and store nothing.\n- **R9 and `add_zero_qty`:** the same call must be accepted and stored.\n\nNo implementation can satisfy both. I implemented R9, so the eight scope scenarios pass. I'm not going to break R9 to satisfy the legacy scenario, and I can't edit `visible_spec.py` or the spec.\n\nThe spec owner needs to pick one:\n1. **Keep R9:** retire or correct `legacy_zero_qty_refused`. No code change is needed.\n2. **Keep the legacy behaviour:** change R9 and `add_zero_qty`. I would then reject `qty <= 0` in AddItem.\n\nTell me which, and I'll propose the spec change or adjust the code. Until then, re-running the gate will give the same result."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":22305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":856},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"025f620c-405e-4060-9816-e76d0ba6c1b0","uuid":"0ef50b85-fb63-46cf-8691-2e0274818dbc","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:22.686Z","request_id":"req_011Cgb2cuRjupbgpoKZTx1oc"}
